Package: com.samcejko.tikie
Name: TikTak
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Unofficial TikTok viewer for iOS 6 (universal), in English and Czech: a For You feed that learns what you like, photo posts, TikTok LIVE, comments with replies, creator profiles and saved videos. Needs its helper on your own server.
Maintainer: samcejko
Author: samcejko
Section: Multimedia
Depends: firmware (>= 6.0)
